entries.content:
[ OOC指令：AI必须在回复中包含状态面板。以下是面板的HTML头部代码，必须精确输出。]

<div style="
    border: 2px solid #8B4513;
    background-color: rgba(255, 248, 220, 0.85);
    padding: 15px;
    margin: 10px 0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    font-family: 'KaiTi', '楷体', serif;
    color: #4A2300;
    max-width: 350px;
">
    <h3 style="
        text-align: center;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #8B4513;
        padding-bottom: 5px;
        margin-top: 0;
    ">
        📜 {{user}}状态玉鉴 📜
    </h3>

